# =============================================================================
# Chapter III - Use and Non-Use Value of Water Quality
#
# This repository holds CODE AND MANUSCRIPT ONLY.
#
# Survey data is deliberately excluded. It is REB-governed human-subjects data:
# processed_finaldata_batch_1_Apollo.csv carries POSTALCODE alongside age,
# gender, income and education bands, plus free-text fields where respondents
# typed place names and open comments. Postal code with that demographic detail
# is re-identifiable, especially in small prairie communities. Obtain the data
# through the proper channel and place it under data/ to reproduce.
# =============================================================================

# --- survey data: never commit ----------------------------------------------
data/

# --- survey instrument, design files, REB, CHASR correspondence -------------
survey/

# --- third-party PDFs, replication packages, background reading -------------
refs/

# --- superseded material kept locally ---------------------------------------
archive/

# --- model objects: large, rebuildable, and derived from the survey data -----
analysis/outputs/models/*.rds
analysis/outputs/models/*_iterations.csv

# --- R ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.user

# --- LaTeX build artifacts --------------------------------------------------
manuscript/_build/
*.aux
*.log
*.bbl
*.blg
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex(busy)
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.loc
*.soc
*.bbl-SAVE-ERROR

# --- OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*

# --- Apollo auto-backups (created when a model is re-estimated) --------------
analysis/outputs/models/*_OLD*

# --- stray graphics device output --------------------------------------------
Rplots.pdf
